      "message": "Done.\n\nFactored the repeated fragment into `CharsetUtil.forNameOrUtf8` (java/com/google/gerrit/common/CharsetUtil.java) — it resolves a possibly-null/invalid charset name and raises a checked IOException for an unknown/illegal one, defaulting a null name to UTF-8.\n\nThe shared Basic auth header decoding is now in `BasicAuthHeader` (java/com/google/gerrit/httpd/BasicAuthHeader.java), so ProjectBasicAuthFilter and ProjectOAuthFilter both call the helper instead of repeating the try/catch.\n\nThe RawMailParser copy is gone as well, via mime4j\u0027s `TextBody.getReader()`, see base commit in this series.",
